      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "They can't make it 'more simple'. It's already stupid simple for idiots to do it (not including myself *cough*).\n\nThey literally can't make it more simpler without the need for prior approval with avatars, where they can verify it's rigged and ready to go.\n\nIf you find it too difficult, then you're pretty much not their target audience for importing avatars. Just follow a YouTube tutorial.",
