      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Right now it's about as simple as importing an avatar can be, ASIDE from using other people's pre-made avatars that have already been imported. You know, the ones you find on pedestals in other worlds. So if you want to use an avatar, but don't want to import it yourself, find one in an avatar world. That's precisely what people make those worlds for.",
